 01  WRD-TABLE REDEFINES WRD-VALUES.
     05  WRD PIC X(9) OCCURS 19.
 01  LOWS.
     05  FILLER PIC X(26) VALUE "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz".
 01  LOW-T REDEFINES LOWS.
     05  LOW-C PIC X OCCURS 26.
 01  TXT  PIC X(10) VALUE "Hello now".
 01  TXT-T REDEFINES TXT.
     05  TXT-C PIC X OCCURS 10.
 01  I PIC 99.
 01  OUTW PIC X(9).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE 3 TO I.
     MOVE WRD(I) TO OUTW.
     DISPLAY "P1 THREE " OUTW.
     DISPLAY "P2 NINETEEN " WRD(19).
     DISPLAY "P3 c " LOW-C(3).
     IF TXT-C(2) = LOW-C(5) DISPLAY "P4 Y" END-IF.
     MOVE "X" TO TXT-C(1).
     DISPLAY "P5 Xello now " TXT.
     IF TXT-C(3) IS ALPHABETIC-LOWER DISPLAY "P6 Y" END-IF.
     STOP RUN.
